Short:    Convert AminetCD 'Files.BBS' to TA BBS
Author:   Kevin Tankard 3:635/717.0@fidonet
Type:     comm/bbs

This little Arexx program is designed for TransAmiga Sysops to convert
Files.BBS off any AMINET CD to TransAmiga format. It also creates the hard
disk shadow directories (for the multiple assign needed to use a CD with
TA) and it creates a File.cfg segment.

Very simple to use and saves a HEAP of time and frustration.
